WEBVTT

00:15.000 --> 00:15.880
FRESHMEN INITIATION

00:15.960 --> 00:21.760
Have you ever done something
just because it's what has been passed on?

00:24.080 --> 00:27.640
And sometimes, we don't know
what it is that we're passing on.

00:29.880 --> 00:33.200
A lot of people
would call this "tradition,"

00:33.280 --> 00:36.800
which is often followed by
another word… "decent."

00:39.000 --> 00:40.160
But is it really decent?

02:10.080 --> 02:11.760
FRESHMEN INITIATION

02:11.840 --> 02:15.440
Good job, everyone. Sit down! Sit!

02:16.960 --> 02:18.200
Everyone,

02:19.040 --> 02:20.240
my name is Kaye.

02:20.320 --> 02:23.800
I'm this year's president of
the cheering and welcoming activity

02:23.880 --> 02:25.360
for the first-year students.

02:26.400 --> 02:29.720
As you know,
the school's welcoming activity

02:29.800 --> 02:31.680
is an ancient tradition that's so decent

02:31.760 --> 02:33.840
and has been passed on
from generation to generation,

02:33.920 --> 02:37.520
from our fathers' generation
to our generation, your seniors.

02:37.600 --> 02:41.360
So, it's our job to pass on this tradition

02:41.440 --> 02:43.320
to you who are our juniors.

02:44.280 --> 02:45.360
I'd like to officially open

02:45.440 --> 02:47.680
this welcoming activity
for first-year students.

02:51.920 --> 02:53.040
Everyone, are you hungry now?

02:53.120 --> 02:54.440
-Yes, we are!
-Yes, we are!

02:54.520 --> 02:55.520
Are you hungry?

02:55.600 --> 02:56.800
-Yes, we are!
-Yes, we are!

02:58.520 --> 03:02.160
Let's make a group of four
and face each other.

03:09.600 --> 03:10.720
Excuse me.

03:12.000 --> 03:13.200
Open it.

03:16.920 --> 03:17.960
Eat it.

03:18.040 --> 03:19.120
Go ahead and eat.

03:19.200 --> 03:21.400
-Aren't you hungry?
-What are you waiting for?

03:22.560 --> 03:23.680
What are you waiting for?

03:24.760 --> 03:27.120
-Eat it!
-Get closer.

03:27.200 --> 03:28.640
Get in there and have a bite.

03:28.720 --> 03:29.960
Don't be sluggish!

03:30.040 --> 03:31.080
Eat!

03:31.960 --> 03:33.440
Shit, he's throwing up!

03:38.840 --> 03:39.920
You dumbass.

03:56.320 --> 03:58.520
Does anyone know the motto here?

03:58.600 --> 04:03.880
-Erudition. Unity. Generosity.
-Erudition. Unity. Generosity.

04:04.560 --> 04:08.280
Well, no. That's the school's proverb.

04:09.160 --> 04:11.800
The motto here is

04:12.640 --> 04:14.240
"Don't mind the monks,

04:15.000 --> 04:16.440
but if you see a senior…

04:19.000 --> 04:22.279
you must pay respect."

04:24.040 --> 04:26.480
So if the seniors order you
to do something, you must follow it.

04:32.880 --> 04:33.960
Bring me the board.

04:35.640 --> 04:37.840
This song is very easy to sing along to.

04:38.640 --> 04:41.640
And I'd like you all
to dance to the song as well.

04:41.720 --> 04:43.560
I'll demonstrate for you to see first.

04:43.640 --> 04:46.480
Ready, set, go!

04:46.560 --> 04:49.760
When I was raped, when I was raped

04:49.840 --> 04:52.480
He spread my legs, he spread my legs

04:52.560 --> 04:54.560
He forced me, he forced me
To close my eyes

04:54.640 --> 04:57.160
Under the bridge, I was torn apart

04:57.240 --> 04:59.800
If it were a few men, it'd be all right
But there were 50 to 60 men

05:04.680 --> 05:05.560
It's not difficult.

05:06.840 --> 05:09.080
Let's give it a try, shall we?
Let's do it once, all right?

05:09.160 --> 05:11.440
-Get up!
-Get up!

05:11.520 --> 05:14.040
-Get up.
-Get up! Quickly!

05:14.960 --> 05:17.800
Excuse me, I…
I don't know how to dance like that.

05:21.680 --> 05:25.080
All right, guys, sit down first.

05:32.440 --> 05:35.280
Okay, if it's too hard,
then let's change the game.

05:35.360 --> 05:36.560
I guarantee that you can do it.

05:38.120 --> 05:42.880
TEAM BUILDING ACTIVITY

05:42.960 --> 05:46.240
This one is like the pride
of our school's welcoming activity.

05:47.560 --> 05:49.000
I call it, "The Human Centipede."

05:50.520 --> 05:53.080
The rule is everyone has to get down
on their hands and knees

05:54.040 --> 05:57.520
and use your head to touch the butt
of the person in front of you.

05:57.600 --> 05:59.840
And that person will use his or her head

05:59.920 --> 06:01.640
to touch the butt of the person in front.

06:01.720 --> 06:03.880
And go on, and on, and on.

06:05.720 --> 06:08.280
And we'll see our unity, to become one.

06:15.320 --> 06:19.800
Why does your "unity" seem so horny?

06:20.720 --> 06:23.240
