08:38.360 --> 08:42.240
Take your shirts off! Hurry up.

08:55.720 --> 08:57.000
You too.

09:11.480 --> 09:13.680
Good.

09:15.240 --> 09:16.920
So shouldn't you all love each other?

09:17.560 --> 09:19.120
Is that good? Good idea, right?

09:19.680 --> 09:22.000
-Everyone, stand up!
-Get up.

09:22.080 --> 09:24.920
-And take your shirts off!
-Move it.

09:26.440 --> 09:28.680
-Take your shirts off!
-Quickly!

09:31.320 --> 09:32.280
Oh, my!

09:34.800 --> 09:37.160
Okay. Everyone,
