09:37.720 --> 09:40.080
One. Look at the camera.

09:40.160 --> 09:41.840
One, two…

09:43.120 --> 09:44.920
Guys, go home safely.

09:45.000 --> 09:46.240
-See you.
-Yes, later.

09:49.680 --> 09:53.000
