25:32.520 --> 25:34.920
If you see monks,
you don't have to pay respect.

25:35.000 --> 25:36.200
But if you see seniors…

25:36.280 --> 25:39.840
…you have to pay respect.

25:39.920 --> 25:41.280
Please.

25:42.560 --> 25:45.800
WELCOME FRESHMEN

25:46.960 --> 25:48.560
Do it properly.

25:50.720 --> 25:51.640
Bless you.

26:02.040 --> 26:03.200
Kaye,

26:04.000 --> 26:06.080
I have prepared a special senior for you.

26:09.800 --> 26:11.040
Whoa, here comes the big guy.

26:13.080 --> 26:14.760
-Good evening.
-Hello, senior.

26:22.840 --> 26:23.760
But this is a dog.

26:25.960 --> 26:31.240
Although he's a dog,
Lucky is considered your senior.

26:31.760 --> 26:33.800
Lucky has been here before me.

26:35.520 --> 26:38.760
Kaye, are you going to let
this seniority system that we all value

26:38.840 --> 26:41.040
become blemished because of you?

26:44.320 --> 26:45.160
I'm not doing it.

26:46.160 --> 26:47.200
Do it.

26:49.440 --> 26:50.920
I told you to prostrate.

26:51.000 --> 26:52.400
Why is it difficult?

26:52.480 --> 26:54.240
Senior Lucky has been waiting
for a long time.

27:01.640 --> 27:03.280
Can't you do it willingly?

27:05.520 --> 27:06.840
Why is it so difficult?

27:07.680 --> 27:10.280
You asshole. Are you not going to
pay respect to your seniors?

27:11.360 --> 27:14.600
Are you being insolent? Get up!

27:14.680 --> 27:15.920
Pay respect to your senior.

27:25.240 --> 27:30.480
Put your palms together nicely,
and then prostrate to pay respect.

27:36.040 --> 27:38.800
Lower your head more, Kaye.

27:40.520 --> 27:42.600
It's not hard.
It's just a tiny little thing.

27:43.760 --> 27:45.280
Senior Lucky is satisfied now.

28:18.000 --> 28:21.600
Fuck, Kaye.
Can you just do what seniors say?

28:21.680 --> 28:24.400
You know, you alone

28:25.000 --> 28:26.840
got us all in big trouble.

28:27.480 --> 28:31.720
If you behave better tomorrow,
we'll let you sleep here.

28:45.440 --> 28:46.400
What?

28:49.520 --> 28:50.920
What the fuck is wrong with you?

29:05.840 --> 29:07.040
Oh, my…

29:07.960 --> 29:09.920
it's all right, Lucky.

29:10.760 --> 29:15.440
Kaye just misses the time he was a senior
when he could just mess with people.

29:26.120 --> 29:27.680
What the fuck do you want from me?

29:29.960 --> 29:31.480
I just want…

29:39.200 --> 29:41.760
What Junior Nanno wants…

29:43.880 --> 29:47.320
What Junior Nanno wants…

29:53.440 --> 29:54.280
Oops!

29:59.920 --> 30:01.040
Everyone,

30:02.200 --> 30:03.960
Kaye hurt Senior Lucky.

30:04.600 --> 30:06.680
Senior Lucky has run away!

30:13.360 --> 30:14.280
That's too bad.

30:15.920 --> 30:16.760
Lucky.

30:18.120 --> 30:19.880
-Lucky.
-Lucky.

30:19.960 --> 30:22.080
-Lucky.
-Lucky.

30:22.160 --> 30:23.400
Let's split up.

30:23.480 --> 30:24.960
-Lucky!
-Where are you, Lucky?

30:25.040 --> 30:25.880
Lucky!

30:30.120 --> 30:32.160
Where is Lucky? Have you found him?

30:42.400 --> 30:43.360
Well…

30:43.840 --> 30:45.640
I've been trying
to look for him all night,

30:45.720 --> 30:47.920
but he's nowhere to be found.

30:49.800 --> 30:52.560
Please don't punish us.

30:53.200 --> 30:56.200
Right now, we have more important things
to deal with than that.

30:57.440 --> 30:59.920
We have to appoint
the new dog of the class.

31:01.800 --> 31:06.640
If we can find someone
to replace the missing Lucky,

31:07.200 --> 31:09.360
what would you guys say?

31:15.800 --> 31:17.040
-Grab him.
-Get over here!

31:18.200 --> 31:19.480
-Get down!
-Down!

31:20.320 --> 31:21.680
Down!

31:21.760 --> 31:23.040
-I told you, get down!
-Sit down!

31:23.120 --> 31:25.200
-Hold him down.
-What's wrong with him?

31:25.280 --> 31:26.720
Right now, you're a dog.

31:27.280 --> 31:28.840
You need to play as a dog.

31:28.920 --> 31:31.440
You must be obedient
and follow my orders like a dog.

31:31.920 --> 31:32.920
Down!

31:33.000 --> 31:34.080
Push his legs down.

31:34.160 --> 31:35.560
-Get down.
-Grab his legs.

31:36.560 --> 31:38.440
Stay still! Be still!

31:38.520 --> 31:39.920
How fucking stubborn you are!

31:40.640 --> 31:43.240
-What the fuck are you doing?
-What the fuck?

31:47.240 --> 31:49.480
Don't pick on Kelly.

31:50.560 --> 31:52.480
Get him up! Get up!

31:52.560 --> 31:53.640
Get the hell up!

31:57.960 --> 31:59.360
You're so cute.

32:00.360 --> 32:01.520
Let's play, me and you.

32:06.080 --> 32:08.320
Could you please release Kelly?

32:12.720 --> 32:17.320
Fetch it, all right? One, two…

32:18.680 --> 32:19.680
three.

32:23.960 --> 32:24.960
Go on!

32:26.160 --> 32:27.600
Go fetch it!

32:29.000 --> 32:30.080
Go!

32:35.720 --> 32:37.200
He likes to be kicked.

32:39.760 --> 32:40.600
Hurry up!

32:46.440 --> 32:47.760
Kelly, hurry up!

32:53.120 --> 32:54.000
Pick it up.

32:54.080 --> 32:57.200
One, two, three.

33:00.560 --> 33:02.760
-That's good.
-Oh, he's running pretty fast.

33:02.840 --> 33:03.800
Come here.

33:03.880 --> 33:06.000
-Faster.
-Get over here.

33:24.640 --> 33:25.760
Paw, please.

33:30.800 --> 33:31.640
Another one, please.

33:34.800 --> 33:37.200
What comes after a paw shake?

33:38.240 --> 33:39.320
What do you do?

33:45.760 --> 33:47.840
You're adorable.

33:48.800 --> 33:50.440
Oh, my…

34:24.880 --> 34:26.600
Say ah…

34:30.000 --> 34:31.639
Yummy.

34:36.400 --> 34:39.120
See? Being a dog

34:39.840 --> 34:41.400
is better than being a centipede.

34:42.360 --> 34:43.679
And if you're not satisfied,

34:44.800 --> 34:46.920
you can take it all out
on the juniors next year.

34:47.719 --> 34:49.360
If Kaye survives…

34:58.840 --> 34:59.960
I'm sorry.

35:00.960 --> 35:02.120
I'm sorry.

35:03.040 --> 35:05.160
I'm sorry? No, Junior Kaye is sorry.

35:08.960 --> 35:10.120
Please let me go.

35:11.240 --> 35:13.160
What? I can't hear you.

35:14.200 --> 35:15.920
Please let me go.

35:17.360 --> 35:18.880
I won't do it anymore.

35:18.960 --> 35:19.960
Can you speak louder?

35:20.040 --> 35:21.520
Please let me go.

35:24.920 --> 35:26.120
Please let me go.

35:30.560 --> 35:34.040
Please let me go.

35:36.280 --> 35:37.840
There, there.

35:41.240 --> 35:42.600
In case you get hungry.

35:46.760 --> 35:51.760
Don't go.

35:53.920 --> 35:55.360
Don't go.

36:39.520 --> 36:41.080
I feel sorry for you.

36:45.000 --> 36:46.520
Do you want to get out of here?

36:49.400 --> 36:50.640
Please let me go.

37:06.600 --> 37:07.680
Thank you.

37:22.840 --> 37:24.160
What are you doing, Yuri?

37:27.920 --> 37:29.840
Your method is so sluggish,

37:29.920 --> 37:30.960
so slow.

37:33.480 --> 37:36.080
Everyone, Kelly has run away!

37:42.280 --> 37:43.400
Where the fuck did he go?

37:43.480 --> 37:44.800
-Kaye!
-Don't be afraid, K.

37:44.880 --> 37:47.080
-You're fucking dead when we get back.
-Come out!

37:47.160 --> 37:48.280
-Show yourself!
-Kaye!

37:48.360 --> 37:50.640
Don't hide, Kaye.

37:50.720 --> 37:52.680
-Kaye!
-Just wait until we find you, you bastard.

37:53.320 --> 37:56.360
You two go that way,
and you, the other way.

40:52.040 --> 40:54.560
Those big ones kept biting me.
My legs are all red.

40:55.200 --> 40:57.480
-Mosquitoes?
-Hell, the repellent doesn't fucking help.

40:58.840 --> 40:59.720
Damn it.

40:59.800 --> 41:02.080
The woods are full of mosquitoes.
When can we go?

41:02.160 --> 41:04.240
-You want to come over?
-Will you come with me?

41:04.320 --> 41:06.720
Why did you take my picture?
I got mud in my mouth.

41:06.800 --> 41:08.920
-Was it when you were crying to Pae?
-Yes.

41:09.000 --> 41:11.520
-Who else was there?
-What was his name? Was it Yong?

41:11.600 --> 41:15.080
-It was the guy with buckteeth.
-That's right.

41:15.160 --> 41:17.480
-Yes.
-Remember when he sang

41:17.560 --> 41:19.400
-the faculty's chant?
-Damn.

41:20.000 --> 41:22.000
Yes, and where is he?

41:22.080 --> 41:23.600
Fuck him.

41:23.680 --> 41:24.560
He might be dead.

41:26.360 --> 41:27.280
Acting so tough.

41:30.160 --> 41:32.800
-If I ever saw that asshole…
-Don't compare us to him.

41:32.880 --> 41:34.760
We're like the nicest seniors.

41:39.200 --> 41:40.560
These fucking kids…

41:50.240 --> 41:51.840
Hey! It's Kaye!

41:51.920 --> 41:53.480
Go after him!

41:53.560 --> 41:55.640
Get over here!

41:59.480 --> 42:02.080
You bastard! Where are you going?

42:02.160 --> 42:04.680
-Stop right there.
-Come back, asshole.

42:04.760 --> 42:07.000
-Get back here.
-Kaye, get over here.

42:08.240 --> 42:09.080
Come fucking here!

42:09.760 --> 42:10.640
Come here!

42:10.720 --> 42:12.600
You're a coward! Get up here!

42:12.680 --> 42:14.120
-Get up here!
-Everyone!

42:14.200 --> 42:16.080
I've found Lucky's body!

42:17.840 --> 42:19.160
Shit!

42:19.240 --> 42:20.360
You scum.

42:20.440 --> 42:22.200
How could you do it, Kaye?

42:22.280 --> 42:23.720
I didn't fucking kill Lucky!

42:24.440 --> 42:27.920
I didn't fucking let Lucky out either!
And I didn't fucking grab Nanno's ass!

42:29.720 --> 42:32.880
She was the one who started it!
It's because of her!

42:32.960 --> 42:35.800
She's the one who made me
be with you all, assholes!

42:35.880 --> 42:38.040
-We don't believe you!
-You're lying.

42:38.120 --> 42:40.720
Why don't you fucking believe me?

42:40.800 --> 42:42.880
So this is your method?

42:43.520 --> 42:45.840
Yes, isn't it fun?

42:46.680 --> 42:48.520
It's more effective and faster than yours.

42:51.320 --> 42:55.680
You had to kill Lucky?
This is a very low-class method.

42:58.400 --> 42:59.640
Everyone!

43:01.000 --> 43:03.760
Kaye killed Lucky,
so he has to pay for what he did.

43:04.560 --> 43:06.680
Whoever can hit Kaye's head the most

43:06.760 --> 43:08.600
will be the leader of the new students.

43:08.680 --> 43:11.040
And you won't have to attend
the welcoming activity anymore.

43:19.000 --> 43:21.640
Lucky must have been really proud
of his sacrifice.

43:24.800 --> 43:27.160
Don't you think that if we let Kaye go,

43:27.240 --> 43:29.840
he will do exactly the same
to the juniors next year?

43:31.960 --> 43:33.760
You're so quick to judge, Yuri.

43:37.280 --> 43:41.120
I can't believe
what just came out of your mouth.

43:42.160 --> 43:45.760
If you're still like this,
I may have to replace you eventually.

43:47.920 --> 43:49.120
Then what are you waiting for?

45:29.120 --> 45:34.120
Subtitle translation by:
Tanada Hantaweewatana
